| $\hat S^{\mathrm{OOS}}_k$ | $\sqrt{252}\cdot\operatorname{mean}(\text{daily pnl}^{\mathrm{OOS}}_k)\,/\,\operatorname{std}(\text{daily pnl}^{\mathrm{OOS}}_k)$ — annualized out-of-sample Sharpe. |
| $T_k$ | Length of strategy $k$'s OOS window, **in years**. |

Unobserved: the true Sharpe $S_k$. All dispersions below are **cross-sectional** — spread *across the $K$ strategies*,
